Propellerhead Remote Mapping File
File Format Version	1.0.0
Control Surface Manufacturer	Akai
Control Surface Model	MPK Mini Play
Map Version	1.0.0


//======================================================================
//  ID8 Instrument Device
//
//  Pads      -> category / sound / preset navigation
//  Knobs 1-4A-> volume & instrument parameters   (CC21-24)
//  Knobs 1-4B-> reserved (parameter templates)   (CC25-28)
//  Joystick X-> (no pitch bend; retargetable via override)
//  Joystick Y-> (no mod wheel; retargetable via override)
//  Keyboard  -> Keyboard
//
//  NOTE: ID8 is a preset player; it exposes no pitch bend,
//  mod wheel, or drum pads. With a multi-instrument patch the
//  active instrument only responds to its own channel.
//======================================================================

Scope	Propellerheads	ID8 Instrument Device
// Define Group	Keyboard Shortcut Variations	Browse	Preset
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item	Scale	Mode

Map	_Scope		"ID8"
Map	Keyboard		Keyboard

// --- Pads (Bank A): categories & sounds --------------
Map	Pad 1		Select Previous Category
Map	Pad 2		Select Next Category
Map	Pad 3		Select Previous Sound
Map	Pad 4		Select Next Sound

// --- Pads (Bank B): presets & reserved ----------------
Map	Pad 5		Select Previous Preset
Map	Pad 6		Select Next Preset
// Map Pad 7		Select Previous Category
// Map Pad 8		Select Next Category

// --- Knob Bank A (CC21-24): ID8 parameters -----------
Map	Knob 1 A		Volume
Map	Knob 2 A		Parameter 1
Map	Knob 3 A		Parameter 2
// Map Knob 4 A		Volume

// --- Knob Bank B (CC25-28): reserved -----------------
// ID8 exposes only Volume / Parameter 1 / Parameter 2;
// ready-to-enable repeat templates:
// Map Knob 1 B		Volume
// Map Knob 2 B		Parameter 1
// Map Knob 3 B		Parameter 2

// --- Joystick / wheels -------------------------------
// ID8 responds to neither pitch bend nor mod wheel.
//Map	Joystick X		Pitch Bend
//Map	Joystick Y		Mod Wheel